id: ferocious-mark
name: Ferocious
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Ferocious Fighter (4)'s, for the one Signature Technique - Wild's (1) left out while it is held
# (states/feral.dbu), taken off as that Maneuver is concluded (chat.mjs reservedEnds).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Ferocious Fighter: this Signature Technique is used ignoring the Wild level's first effect.
text: >
  Ferocious Fighter (4): While in the Feral State, you may use the Signature Technique Maneuver, ignoring the 1st effect of
  the Wild level of the Feral State.

